  "content": {
    "id": "p8-p4-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "10",
    "prompt": "Factorise $5^{n+1}+5^n$, and hence simplify $\\frac{5^{101}+5^{100}}{6}$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$5^{n+1}+5^n=6\\times5^n$. The fraction simplifies to $5^{100}$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}5^{n+1}+5^n&=5^n(5+1)\\\\5^{n+1}+5^n&=6\\times5^n\\end{align*}$$\n\nSet $n=100$ in the factorisation.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{5^{101}+5^{100}}{6}&=\\frac{6\\times5^{100}}{6}\\\\\\frac{5^{101}+5^{100}}{6}&=5^{100}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 25
  },
